# Actor kind $67's start ($83:E5F1), the backdrop drift of stage a5 s2:
# its actor is live in the state (record $0B5B, waiting in its cycle) and
# the stage is never started from its beginning by a script, so its start
# never runs. The record is put back in its start state ($0C) and the
# actor loop starts it again by its kind's table; then two whole cycles
# (down, slowing, the rest, up, slowing, the rest: about 610 frames each).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a5_s2.state
wait 2
poke 000B5B 0C
wait 1300
